# A sealed chamber of Hoenn (the Ancient Tomb, plan 21 · H6, part b): a still, cold hall where a few bell notes fall
# in bare fifths over a held choir and a low drone, with a soft timpani stroke every other bar, the same by day and
# night. Original composition for this game.
title Sealed Chamber
tempo 60
meter 4/4
reverb 0.5
night none

track air choir vol=0.66 pan=-0.1 rev=0.5
  L o4 (d a)1 | (d a)1 | (c g)1 | (c g)1 | (d f a)1 | (d f a)1 | (c e g)1 | (d a)1 |

track code bell vol=0.66 pan=0.25 rev=0.55
  L o5 d8 r8 a8 r8 r2 | r1 | o5 c8 r8 g8 r8 r2 | r1 | o5 f8 r8 a8 r8 o6 d4 r4 | r1 | o5 e8 r8 g8 r8 o6 c4 r4 | r1 |

track drone contrabass vol=0.9 rev=0.3
  L o2 d1 | d1 | c1 | c1 | d1 | d1 | c1 | d1 |

track stroke timpani vol=0.6 rev=0.4
  L [ o2 d4 r2. | r1 | ]4
